      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹76.73 (vs ₹10.21 in FY 2025)",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹76.73 (up from ₹10.21 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹1.07b (up 288% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹130.2m (up ₹114.9m from FY 2025). Profit margin: 12% (up from 5.5% in FY 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 121% per year but the company’s share price has only increased by 64% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings growth.",
